Package: redistrict
Title: Match Congressional Districts Across Redistricting Cycles
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Charlie", "Grabois", , "chgrabois@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides Hungarian, greedy, and naive algorithms for matching
    U.S. congressional districts across consecutive redistricting cycles
    based on population or area overlap, plus helpers for building
    multi-cycle district panels and validating matches against incumbent
    behavior.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/cgrabois/redistrict
BugReports: https://github.com/cgrabois/redistrict/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    clue,
    dplyr,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    stringr,
    tidyr,
    utils
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
